{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"6f18d084ee521dd0cce35af4a58269ea5f6a76eba9a9920c85d43bc94c271140","ja":"ステージのあとしまつ","zh":"舞台后的收尾","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"015b32570f2a9c552eaff40823daa774433f7eba1a25d19b1f44cf2b2bdc3384","ja":"えへへ、楽しかった～！\n今日の会場、とってもにぎやかだったね！","zh":"嘿嘿，好开心～！\n今天的会场真热闹呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"db4345e11e4adcf9d4302829bcd8776f9331ea5df5c5e662e891ee4342848e7a","ja":"うん、すぐ近くで他のイベントもやってたしね。\n向こうに負けないようにって、張り切っちゃったよ。","zh":"嗯，毕竟就在附近也有其他活动在办呢。\n为了不输给那边，我可是干劲十足哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d756ab53e3dd1e83c30eac2c4b536fb23b4de551a4a7057f20c5694f3d210b7f","ja":"喉乾いちゃったし、これからみんなでカフェにでも\n……って、あれ？　静香は？","zh":"口好渴啊，待会儿大家一起去咖啡厅什么的……\n……咦，奇怪？静香呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"74e66163181253cd44161200b7b86d33714c94ba1df213b74914bda1008208bb","ja":"あ、いたいた！　静香、何やってるの？","zh":"啊，找到了找到了！静香，你在做什么呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e3ce367fe60a4bc1db2056a931a5bc0ed414d5157554e66cb5905ec51f163e72","ja":"えっ……あ、すみません。\n実はその……。","zh":"哎……啊，不好意思。\n其实那个……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b4138c40bdde1280d439c51ae89b7dcab2d0888b52b581fb2c82d51ef7f3e2dd","ja":"他のグループのイベント会場が、荒れているのが\nステージから見えてたんです。それで、つい……。","zh":"在舞台上能看到其他组合的活动现场\n乱成了一团。所以，不知不觉就……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3afc14cccad4d162a88b604c7316ab1c949bcb16640077dfdcee34a48dfc7803","ja":"ホントだ！\nゴミとかそのまま。マナー悪いな……。","zh":"真的耶！\n垃圾之类的都直接丢在那。太没素质了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c98ae19ad097ec8e983cf3beb4c94b514bfead5db969bd0e0a90cc1ee0ce4803","ja":"うん、このまま帰るなんてひどい！","zh":"嗯，要是就这样回去也太过分了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"848a7198f8ea0970ea4b4410cd8c93e5a9577fe675ae46cb3669476eed197fa4","ja":"ええ。だから、ゴミ拾いをしようと思って。\n歩さんたちは先に帰……。","zh":"嗯。所以我想去捡垃圾。\n步她们先回……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"76e76feabf770d1c816d4e71bb6c869d26c1ba88ae43874b8d9c2bd727b5f1a2","ja":"よーし、アタシもゴミ拾いするよ。","zh":"好——我也来捡垃圾吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"c4891f7f2f7c5382733edd31261e858ba69ca3a228c1e63b213ced29abb46f4f","ja":"え、でも……。","zh":"咦，但是……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b2e2971c40abc532f84727dc8f35b220680b31ab794115c291442af14d242178","ja":"わたしも！\n他の人にも迷惑だもん！","zh":"我也去！\n而且也会给其他人添麻烦的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"ed42d62318771e0d9affbd5594a23b832c68199c9f3d86922b3c84e6ec53c600","ja":"ありがとうございます！\nそれじゃあ、一緒に掃除しましょう！","zh":"谢谢你！\n那么，我们一起打扫吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"1202f3e8581f1e92fad7a222b9c565d0750eaad2cc5d1e4615f4a4aa7e78852c","ja":"あの、みんな……どうしたの……？\nあっ、ゴミ拾い、するんだ……？","zh":"那个，大家……怎么了吗……？\n啊，是要去捡垃圾……吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"e3db6b603784502a30124cb07bd6006143cacd5fc3004359f8b48fd347d8e3f0","ja":"むぅ……。\nミキのお気に入りの場所がゴミだらけなの！","zh":"唔……。\n美希喜欢的地方全是垃圾啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"fe6b63e1983d5be2c31c2ffd111d7319c532362b152c7c290d6a80372992b50a","ja":"ここでお昼寝するの、\nすっごく気持ちいいのに……。","zh":"在这里睡午觉，\n明明超级舒服的……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1068.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"ae99250c9552296d5cdae1c9a8cac710b1c8456ba509e9c14bee8af4f2772a46","ja":"そ、それじゃあ私たちも、\n一緒に、ゴミ拾いしよっか……。","zh":"那、那我们也\n一起去捡垃圾吧……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
